Cra: Safe Browsing list updates at most every 4 hours. All of Cra shares one
Google API key and its daily quota; Chrome's ~30 minute interval would cover a
few hundred installs, this about eight times as many. A new phishing site can
take up to 4 hours longer to be blocked.

